00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.240
like in England?

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:36.820
I'm on Zatch Bell, Keo's on vacation,

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:39.760
and I'm psyched 'cause we're all going on a camping trip!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:40.940
- What camping trip?

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:42.160
- You remember, Keo.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.640
You promised Susie you would go,

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.220
and you promised to hang out with Kane

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.360
and all your other friends.

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.180
- Wait a minute.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:49.020
I don't remember making all those promises.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:50.340
- Oh yeah, and you have to cook dinner

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.540
for the whole camp, too.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:52.960
- But I don't know how to cook.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.180
What am I gonna do?

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.000
- Well, you've got one week to learn

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.940
before the next Zatch Bell.
